  "title": "SiriusPoint announces new partnership with ISC",
  "summary": "SiriusPoint has announced a new strategic partnership with Integrated Specialty Coverages (ISC). ISC is a multi-line program administrator, committed to delivering tailored programs across the broker and carrier markets. SiriusPoint has partnered with ISC to support the continued expansion of ISC’s exclusive and wholesale insurance programs, providing underwriting capacity and strategic collaboration across specialty lines. […]",
